#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to do common tasks, from install and authentication to checking job status and fetching error messages"
msgstr "Cara melakukan tugas biasa, daripada pemasangan dan pengesahan sehingga menyemak status kerja dan mendapatkan mesej ralat"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started with Qiskit Functions"
msgstr "Mula menggunakan Qiskit Functions"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/functions-get-started.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore Jarman, HIVQE, Cadavid, Chandarana, Leclerc, Sachdeva, HUBO, Filippov, Downfolding, Aharonov, Mundada, Yamauchi, supersymmetric, Paterakis, Gharibyan, Jaffali, Pellow */}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium, Flex, and On-Prem (through the IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users can get started with IBM Qiskit Functions for free, or can procure a license from one of the partners who have contributed a function to the catalog.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna Pelan Premium, Flex, dan On-Prem (melalui API IBM Quantum Platform) boleh mula menggunakan IBM Qiskit Functions secara percuma, atau boleh mendapatkan lesen daripada salah satu rakan kongsi yang telah menyumbangkan fungsi kepada katalog.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request a free trial for third-party Qiskit Functions {#request-a-free-trial-for-third-party-qiskit-functions}"
msgstr "Minta percubaan percuma untuk Qiskit Functions pihak ketiga {#request-a-free-trial-for-third-party-qiskit-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To request a free trial, navigate to the [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), and explore the details panel. Click `Request a free trial` and fill out information required by the Functions partner, including the IBM Cloud `AccessGroupId`:\n"
msgstr "Untuk meminta percubaan percuma, navigasi ke [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), dan terokai panel butiran. Klik `Request a free trial` dan isi maklumat yang diperlukan oleh rakan kongsi Functions, termasuk `AccessGroupId` IBM Cloud:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to [IBM Cloud IAM](http://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"
msgstr "Navigasi ke [IBM Cloud IAM](http://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify eligibility.\n"
msgstr "Sahkan kelayakan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch your account in the menu bar on the header to one with the following format: `XXXXXXX - [Organization Name]`\n"
msgstr "Tukar akaun anda dalam bar menu pada header kepada satu dengan format berikut: `XXXXXXX - [Organization Name]`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure the organization is the same as the one associated with your Premium account.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan organisasi adalah sama dengan yang berkaitan dengan akaun Premium anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you see \"[Your Name]'s Account\", you are using your _personal_ account, which is not eligible for premium access.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda melihat \"[Your Name]'s Account\", anda menggunakan akaun _peribadi_ anda, yang tidak layak untuk akses premium.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access group ID.\n"
msgstr "Cari ID kumpulan akses anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click a group name.\n"
msgstr "Klik nama kumpulan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Details**.\n"
msgstr "Klik **Details**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Copy the access group ID. It should start with `AccessGroup-`.\n"
msgstr "Salin ID kumpulan akses. Ia sepatutnya bermula dengan `AccessGroup-`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"install-qiskit-functions-catalog-client\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Functions Catalog client {#install-the-qiskit-functions-catalog-client}"
msgstr "Pasang klien Qiskit Functions Catalog {#install-the-qiskit-functions-catalog-client}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To start using Qiskit Functions, install the IBM Qiskit Functions Catalog client:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mula menggunakan Qiskit Functions, pasang klien IBM Qiskit Functions Catalog:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve your API key from the [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), and activate your Python virtual environment.  See the [installation instructions](/guides/install-qiskit#local) if you do not already have a virtual environment set up.\n"
msgstr "Ambil API key anda daripada [papan pemuka IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), dan aktifkan persekitaran maya Python anda. Lihat [arahan pemasangan](/guides/install-qiskit#local) jika anda belum mempunyai persekitaran maya yang disediakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   <span id=\"save-account\"></span>**If you are working in a trusted Python environment (such as on a personal laptop or workstation),** use the `save_account()` method to save your credentials locally. ([Skip to the next step](#functions-untrusted) if you are not using a trusted environment, such as a shared or public computer, to authenticate to IBM Quantum Platform.)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   To use `save_account()`, run `python` in your shell, then enter the following:\n"
msgstr "   Untuk menggunakan `save_account()`, jalankan `python` dalam shell anda, kemudian masukkan yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   Type `exit()`. From now on, whenever you need to authenticate to the service, you can load your credentials with the following:\n"
msgstr "   Taip `exit()`. Mulai sekarang, apabila anda perlu mengesahkan diri ke perkhidmatan, anda boleh memuatkan kelayakan anda dengan yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   For example:\n"
msgstr "   Contohnya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"functions-untrusted\"></span>**Avoid executing code on an untrusted machine or an external cloud Python environment to minimize security risks.** If you must use an untrusted environment (on, for example, a public computer), change your API key after each use by deleting it on the [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page to reduce risk. Learn more in the [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui) topic. To initialize the service in this situation, use this code:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protect your API key\">\n"
"**Never include your key in source code, Python scripts, or notebook files.** When sharing code with others, ensure that your API key is not embedded directly within the Python script. Instead, share the script without the key and provide instructions for securely setting it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protect your API key\">\n"
"**Jangan sekali-kali sertakan key anda dalam kod sumber, skrip Python, atau fail notebook.** Apabila berkongsi kod dengan orang lain, pastikan API key anda tidak dibenamkan terus dalam skrip Python. Sebaliknya, kongsikan skrip tanpa key dan berikan arahan untuk menyediakannya dengan selamat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you accidentally share your key with someone or include it in version control like Git, immediately revoke your key by deleting it on the [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) page to reduce risk. Learn more in the [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui) topic.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda secara tidak sengaja berkongsi key anda dengan seseorang atau menyertakannya dalam kawalan versi seperti Git, segera batalkan key anda dengan memadamkannya pada halaman [IBM Cloud API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) untuk mengurangkan risiko. Ketahui lebih lanjut dalam topik [Managing user API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List the functions you can access {#list-the-functions-you-can-access}"
msgstr "Senaraikan fungsi yang boleh anda akses {#list-the-functions-you-can-access}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you authenticate, you can list the functions from the Qiskit Functions Catalog that you have access to:\n"
msgstr "Selepas anda mengesahkan diri, anda boleh menyenaraikan fungsi daripada Qiskit Functions Catalog yang boleh anda akses:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run enabled functions {#run-enabled-functions}"
msgstr "Jalankan fungsi yang didayakan {#run-enabled-functions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After a catalog object has been instantiated, you can select a function by using `catalog.load(\"<provider/function-name>\")`:\n"
msgstr "Selepas objek katalog dijana contohnya, anda boleh memilih fungsi dengan menggunakan `catalog.load(\"<provider/function-name>\")`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each Qiskit Function has custom inputs, options, and outputs. Check the specific documentation pages for the function you want to run for more information. By default, all users can only run one function job at a time:\n"
msgstr "Setiap Qiskit Function mempunyai input, pilihan, dan output tersendiri. Semak halaman dokumentasi khusus untuk fungsi yang ingin anda jalankan untuk maklumat lanjut. Secara lalai, semua pengguna hanya boleh menjalankan satu kerja fungsi pada satu masa:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`run()` checks your remaining capacity and backend access before it submits the job. If your instance is out of capacity, or the backend you named is not accessible, `run()` raises an error right away instead of leaving the job to fail in the queue. When capacity is low, `run()` emits a warning. Pass `suppress_low_usage_warning=True` to silence it.\n"
msgstr "`run()` menyemak kapasiti baki anda dan akses backend sebelum ia menghantar kerja. Jika instance anda kehabisan kapasiti, atau backend yang anda namakan tidak boleh diakses, `run()` menimbulkan ralat serta-merta dan bukannya membiarkan kerja itu gagal dalam baris gilir. Apabila kapasiti rendah, `run()` mengeluarkan amaran. Hantar `suppress_low_usage_warning=True` untuk membisukannya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"check-job-status\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check job status {#check-job-status}"
msgstr "Semak status kerja {#check-job-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With your Qiskit Function `job_id`, you can check the status of running jobs. This includes the following statuses:\n"
msgstr "Dengan `job_id` Qiskit Function anda, anda boleh menyemak status kerja yang sedang berjalan. Ini termasuk status berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`QUEUED`**: The remote program is in the Qiskit Function queue. The queue priority is based on how much you've used Qiskit Functions.\n"
msgstr "**`QUEUED`**: Program jauh berada dalam baris gilir Qiskit Function. Keutamaan baris gilir adalah berdasarkan berapa banyak anda telah menggunakan Qiskit Functions.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`INITIALIZING`**: The remote program is starting; this includes setting up the remote environment and installing dependencies.\n"
msgstr "**`INITIALIZING`**: Program jauh sedang dimulakan; ini termasuk menyediakan persekitaran jauh dan memasang kebergantungan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING`**: The program is running. This also includes several more detailed statuses if supported by specific functions.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING`**: Program sedang berjalan. Ini juga termasuk beberapa status yang lebih terperinci jika disokong oleh fungsi tertentu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: MAPPING`**: The function is currently mapping your classical inputs to quantum inputs.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: MAPPING`**: Fungsi sedang memetakan input klasik anda kepada input kuantum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`**: The function is optimizing for the selected QPU. This could include circuit transpilation, QPU characterization, observable backpropagation, and so forth.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`**: Fungsi sedang mengoptimumkan untuk QPU yang dipilih. Ini boleh termasuk transpilasi litar, pencirian QPU, perambatan balik cerapan, dan sebagainya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`**: The function has submitted a job to IBM Quantum Compute Service, and is waiting in the queue.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`**: Fungsi telah menghantar kerja ke IBM Quantum Compute Service, dan sedang menunggu dalam baris gilir.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`**: The function has an active Quantum Compute job.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`**: Fungsi mempunyai kerja Quantum Compute yang aktif.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`**: The function is post-processing results, which can include error mitigation, mapping quantum results to classical, and so forth.\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`**: Fungsi sedang memproses pasca keputusan, yang boleh termasuk mitigasi ralat, pemetaan keputusan kuantum kepada klasik, dan sebagainya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`DONE`**: The program is complete, and you can retrieve result data with `job.result()`.\n"
msgstr "**`DONE`**: Program telah selesai, dan anda boleh mengambil data keputusan dengan `job.result()`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`ERROR`**: The program stopped running because of a problem. Use `job.result()` to get the error message.\n"
msgstr "**`ERROR`**: Program berhenti berjalan kerana masalah. Gunakan `job.result()` untuk mendapatkan mesej ralat.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`CANCELED`**: The program was canceled by a user, the service, or the server.\n"
msgstr "**`CANCELED`**: Program telah dibatalkan oleh pengguna, perkhidmatan, atau pelayan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"retrieve-results\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve results {#retrieve-results}"
msgstr "Ambil keputusan {#retrieve-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After a program is `DONE`, you can use `job.result()` to fetch the result. This output format varies with each function, so be sure to follow the specific documentation:\n"
msgstr "Selepas program `DONE`, anda boleh menggunakan `job.result()` untuk mengambil keputusan. Format output ini berbeza-beza mengikut setiap fungsi, jadi pastikan anda mengikuti dokumentasi khusus:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also cancel a job at any time:\n"
msgstr "Anda juga boleh membatalkan kerja pada bila-bila masa:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access the associated Quantum Compute jobs {#access-the-associated-quantum-compute-jobs}"
msgstr "Akses kerja Quantum Compute yang berkaitan {#access-the-associated-quantum-compute-jobs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Qiskit Function can submit one or more Quantum Compute jobs to a QPU while it runs. To retrieve the IDs of those runtime jobs, use `job.runtime_jobs()`. You can use these IDs to fetch the runtime job objects from a `QiskitRuntimeService` instance, or to find the workloads on the IBM Quantum&reg; Platform dashboard.\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Function boleh menghantar satu atau lebih kerja Quantum Compute ke QPU semasa ia berjalan. Untuk mengambil ID kerja masa jalan tersebut, gunakan `job.runtime_jobs()`. Anda boleh menggunakan ID ini untuk mengambil objek kerja masa jalan daripada instance `QiskitRuntimeService`, atau untuk mencari beban kerja pada papan pemuka IBM Quantum&reg; Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a function groups its runtime jobs into sessions or batches, use `job.runtime_sessions()` to list the session IDs. Pass one session ID to `job.runtime_jobs()` to return only the runtime jobs in that session:\n"
msgstr "Jika fungsi mengumpulkan kerja masa jalannya ke dalam sesi atau kelompok, gunakan `job.runtime_sessions()` untuk menyenaraikan ID sesi. Hantar satu ID sesi kepada `job.runtime_jobs()` untuk mengembalikan hanya kerja masa jalan dalam sesi tersebut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The returned list can be empty. A function reports its runtime jobs only when it submits them through the runtime service that the function receives at run time, and some functions do not submit runtime jobs directly.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "View job logs {#view-job-logs}"
msgstr "Lihat log kerja {#view-job-logs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `job.logs()` to retrieve the log output that a function produces while it runs. Logs are useful for tracking progress and for debugging a job that ends in an `ERROR` state.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `job.logs()` untuk mengambil output log yang dihasilkan oleh fungsi semasa ia berjalan. Log berguna untuk menjejaki kemajuan dan untuk menyahpepijat kerja yang berakhir dalam status `ERROR`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a long-running job that produces many log lines, use `job.filtered_logs()` to return only the lines you want. Pass a regular expression to `include` to keep matching lines, or to `exclude` to drop matching lines:\n"
msgstr "Untuk kerja yang berjalan lama dan menghasilkan banyak baris log, gunakan `job.filtered_logs()` untuk mengembalikan hanya baris yang anda mahu. Hantar ungkapan biasa kepada `include` untuk mengekalkan baris yang sepadan, atau kepada `exclude` untuk membuang baris yang sepadan:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List previously run Qiskit Functions jobs {#list-previously-run-qiskit-functions-jobs}"
msgstr "Senaraikan kerja Qiskit Functions yang telah dijalankan sebelum ini {#list-previously-run-qiskit-functions-jobs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use `jobs()` to list all jobs submitted to Qiskit Functions:\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan `jobs()` untuk menyenaraikan semua kerja yang dihantar ke Qiskit Functions:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To narrow the results, pass filters. Filter by function with `function`, by status with `status`, and by submission date with `created_after`. Page through results with `limit` and `offset`:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menyempitkan keputusan, hantar penapis. Tapis mengikut fungsi dengan `function`, mengikut status dengan `status`, dan mengikut tarikh penghantaran dengan `created_after`. Layari keputusan mengikut halaman dengan `limit` dan `offset`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you already have the job ID for a certain job, you can retrieve the job with `catalog.job()`:\n"
msgstr "Jika anda sudah mempunyai ID kerja untuk kerja tertentu, anda boleh mengambil kerja tersebut dengan `catalog.job()`:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fetch error messages {#fetch-error-messages}"
msgstr "Ambil mesej ralat {#fetch-error-messages}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a program status is `ERROR`, use `job.error_message()` to fetch the error message as follows:\n"
msgstr "Jika status program ialah `ERROR`, gunakan `job.error_message()` untuk mengambil mesej ralat seperti berikut:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Explore circuit functions](/guides/algorithmiq-tem) to build new algorithms and applications, without needing to manage transpilation or error handling.\n"
msgstr "[Terokai fungsi litar](/guides/algorithmiq-tem) untuk membina algoritma dan aplikasi baharu, tanpa perlu menguruskan transpilasi atau pengendalian ralat.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Explore application functions](/guides/q-ctrl-optimization-solver) to solve domain-specific tasks, with classical inputs and outputs.\n"
msgstr "[Terokai fungsi aplikasi](/guides/q-ctrl-optimization-solver) untuk menyelesaikan tugas khusus domain, dengan input dan output klasik.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [API reference documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/index) for Qiskit Functions.\n"
msgstr "Lihat [dokumentasi rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/index) untuk Qiskit Functions.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- For hands-on experience, try out some [tutorials](/tutorials/index#leverage-qiskit-capabilities) that demonstrate Qiskit Functions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"- Untuk pengalaman secara praktikal, cuba beberapa [tutorial](/tutorials/index#leverage-qiskit-capabilities) yang menunjukkan Qiskit Functions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
